  "id": "reflect-flow",
  "type": "tab",
  "label": "Reflectance control",
  "disabled": false,
  "info": "Phone control for on-demand AS7341 leaf-reflectance measurements.\n\nCHANGE the device id 'staging-01' in the two function nodes and three mqtt-in topics to target the balcony node.\n\n- Dashboard at /ui : pick a plant, press Measure.\n- HTTP for shortcuts : POST /reflect/measure?plant=<id> (or JSON body {\"plant\":\"...\"}) -> 202 {request_id}.\nA fresh request_id is generated server-side each time (the firmware dedups by it). reflect/cmd is published NON-retained."
